{
  "$schema": "./contract.schema.json",
  "id": "shadcn.switch",
  "name": "Switch",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "status": "draft",
  "description": "SEED contract for the SHADCN round \u2014 props/axes only; anatomy is promoted from captured DOM truth. Subject: shadcn registry defaults vendored via CLI 4.16.2 (radix-vega, sha256 ledger in examples/shadcn/RECON.md \u00a72.2), mounted through the @shadcn-sandbox/ui barrel (RECON \u00a72.1). checked is a VARIANT AXIS (prop-selected Radix data-state rendering \u2014 RECON H4); the real-DOM thumb's translate question is H6.",
